WEBVTT

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.290
Manager!

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:52.150
If I imagined it, it sure was vivid.

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:56.200
In the first place, what would
Godai be doing here anyway?

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:06.260
Not fixed yet?

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:07.940
Don't worry.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.030
You just want to overtake
the tourist bus, right?

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:18.060
I know the route and took a shortcut.
I'm ahead of the bus.

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:20.860
See?

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:28.370
Manager! Wait!

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:37.530
Let's spend the night here.

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:41.270
Look! Isn't it pretty?

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:45.150
Miss! I heard the hot springs baths
are wonderful around here.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.440
I'd like to stop on the way home.

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:48.310
Your skin will be pretty too.

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.120
A hot spring bath?

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.410
She isn't here. That's strange.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.930
The bus is leaving!
Please hurry and get on board.

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:42.500
Is everyone here?

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:43.810
Excuse me.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:49.210
That woman?
She got off at the last bus stop.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:50.280
Huh?

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:52.610
She suddenly said she wanted to go
to the hot springs resort.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:54.410
Did she mention which one?

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:57.310
I'm pretty sure it was--

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.720
I'm here all right, but I don't know
where she's staying.

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:24.240
I'll just have to check
every single one.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.950
So, you're from Tokyo?

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.310
Yes, I had planned to go to Wajima.

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:37.390
Since I suddenly changed my mind,
I don't even have a place to stay.

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:40.990
May I suggest my friend's inn?

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.890
Yes, thank you.

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.640
Otonashi, Kyoko?

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:55.540
No, I don't have a guest by that name.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:56.510
Is that so?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.250
Here it is. Huh?

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:20.430
Excuse me
someone called about me earlier.

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.540
Oh yes, we have your reservation.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:36.490
Beautiful! I'm glad I came.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.540
Maison Ikkoku.

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:49.100
Mrs. Ichinose? This is Kyoko.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:55.740
I suddenly changed my plans.
I'd like to give you the inn's phone number.

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:58.000
There you go again. It isn't necessary.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.200
Nothing out of the ordinary
is happening here.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:01.440
Just in case...

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:02.680
Okay.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:10.930
A plumber is here
for a scheduled inspection.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:15.100
He said the pipes for the basin downstairs
are rusty so he's changing them.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.890
It's no problem at all. I'm handling it.

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:20.930
But...

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:25.060
I'm fine.! I can handle matters
without you.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:29.760
Okay, you're in charge. Is everyone well?

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.330
Yes, fine.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:33.000
I'm fine.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.260
I'm well.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.880
fine! Don't forget my present!

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.120
See? Godai is fine too.

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:40.750
Huh?

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:47.860
Hold it. Come to think of it
I haven't seen Godai for a few days.

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:56.080
After all, Godai is in Tokyo.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:15.580
She doesn't seem to be in this town.

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:20.640
Anyway, I need to find
a place to stay.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.560
Welcome!

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:27.600
You're from Tokyo?

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:28.390
Yes.

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:41.330
Miss Otonashi, have you soaked in
our outdoor bath?

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:43.110
Do you have one?

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:46.850
Yes, you must experience it once
if you stay here.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:47.720
But...

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:50.160
Men and women are separated.

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:53.160
At night, no one uses it.
You'll feel wonderful.

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:10.540
I didn't find her. I guess it was unrealistic
to think I'd find her, on her trip.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:15.380
Tomorrow she's returning to Tokyo.

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.120
I'll have to go home too.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:25.730
I have to go back to work.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:34.490
I wonder where Manager is now.

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:44.770
Standing up or lying down, I'm bored.

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:50.800
I think I'll go and soak
in the outdoor bath...

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:56.920
OUTDOOR BATH

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:16.620
Huh?

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:27.490
It's connected inside.! What should I do?

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:34.330
I guess it's okay. No one is here.

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:54.710
How relaxing...
Tomorrow I return to Tokyo.

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:03.490
All those visions of Godai.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:08.350
Did they mean I wanted him
to come after me?

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:16.420
You'll be all right without me?

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:20.940
I'll be all right.

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:48.530
Why did she cry? Why?

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:10.190
Oh no.! I'm lightheaded.

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:25.000
No! Someone's in here.

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:28.480
Is someone in here?

00:11:58.220 --> 00:11:59.710
Godai!

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:10.240
Excuse me.

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:16.320
Why is he here?
Did he come after me?

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:19.900
I'm not dreaming, am I?

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:24.350
I finally caught up with her, finally...

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:31.570
Godai, are you here for pleasure?

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:41.180
Godai?

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:49.850
He hasn't come up for air.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:04.900
Godai!

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:09.000
Help! Someone, please come!

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:18.480
He'll be fine.
It's just light headedness.

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:25.020
Thank you for your trouble.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:45.550
Now what am I going to do?
He was brought to my room.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:12.220
Why are you here?
Did you come after me?

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:18.330
I don't have any feelings for you.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.870
Or is it mere coincidence?

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.270
Godai, why are you here?

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:39.490
I came after you. I came after you!

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:51.100
I was dreaming. Of course.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.680
How could I catch up with her...

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:59.340
Huh? This room...

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.620
How do you feel?

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:14.230
You fainted in the outdoor bath.
You don't remember?

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.540
Then...

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:30.700
I'm very sorry for causing you trouble!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:36.060
Godai! I'll make tea.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:54.310
Um...

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.280
Are you traveling for pleasure?

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:03.420
Yes, at the last minute.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:08.920
Isn't it a coincidence we both are
visiting the same place?

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.950
Really! I was surprised.

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:17.320
Really. Even the same inn.

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:22.330
The ocean is beautiful from this room.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:25.500
I know. I can see the ocean
from my room too.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:35.540
So, it was a coincidence.
I'm a bit disappointed.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:39.780
I came after you.

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:48.160
How are things with Coach Mitaka?
Why did you cry that time?

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:53.360
I want to ask, but...

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:55.450
And...

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:56.370
Yes?

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:02.670
No, ah, may I have a beer?

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.470
Are you sure you can drink beer?

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.340
Perhaps I should cool down.

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:20.200
May I have some?

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.200
Sure!

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:27.800
Here's to--

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:41.450
Delicious!

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:44.000
Godai--

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:46.850
Uh...

00:17:49.490 --> 00:17:50.330
Um...

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:51.080
Yes?

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:57.720
Are you still questioning what happened
with Coach Mitaka?

00:17:58.680 --> 00:17:59.840
No...

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:04.800
It doesn't bother me at all.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:08.460
But I don't want to be misunderstood.

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:00.700
Is that what happened?

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:02.310
Yes.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:07.490
I was assuming the worst.
What a fool I am!

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:14.370
Which means she cried...

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:22.380
because of what I said!

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:28.610
Manager!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:35.160
I'm sorry, I wasn't paying attention.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.930
The beer is tasty, isn't it?

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:52.080
I wonder what's happening.

00:19:56.430 --> 00:20:00.420
Since Godai is here, I feel relieved.

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:15.260
But is it really a coincidence?

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:23.030
If he came after,
if he came after me, I...

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:32.200
I wonder who is calling at this hour?

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:42.280
Manager? It's me, me!

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:45.170
It's a good thing you gave me
the inn's phone number.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.790
Can you hear? There's water
all over the place!

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:52.640
The water pipes?

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:27.170
Please enjoy your trip.

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:29.640
Manager!

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:37.880
Where is the guest who was
in this room?

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:41.650
Oh, her? She left before dawn.

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:44.290
She said she was returning to
Tokyo on the first train.

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:45.920
Why?

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:47.220
Don't know.

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.410
What a mess!

00:21:58.470 --> 00:22:00.230
How was your trip, Manager?

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:02.650
What are you all doing,
sitting in the hallway?

00:22:02.890 --> 00:22:06.840
We were going to have a drink
before the pipes are fixed.

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:08.010
Huh?

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:13.270
Did Godai catch up with you
in Kanazawa?

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:14.210
Huh?

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:18.090
We were just talking.

00:22:18.460 --> 00:22:21.950
He hasn't been home since
the evening you left.

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:26.430
By the way, you posted your itinerary
on your door, didn't you?

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:27.990
Yes, what about it?

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:35.060
I haven't seen it since that evening.
It just disappeared...

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:38.760
When I called the nursery school,

00:22:38.950 --> 00:22:44.250
they said Godai asked for two days off
because he was on a trip.

00:22:44.890 --> 00:22:49.540
Two days ago is the day after
you left on your trip, isn't it?

00:22:50.670 --> 00:22:52.020
I see.

00:22:53.460 --> 00:22:56.090
Then Godai did--

00:22:58.340 --> 00:23:00.900
I have no idea about Godai.

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:02.130
Are you sure?

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:07.410
I have to clean!
Please help, everyone.

00:23:07.540 --> 00:23:09.600
She suddenly has a burst of energy.

00:23:09.980 --> 00:23:13.390
I wonder where Godai is?

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:15.380
It's a mystery, isn't it?

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:20.120
Someone is talking about me.

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:25.490
I hope she isn't angry at
me for falling asleep.

00:23:46.110 --> 00:23:49.370
Huh? Godai is going to
tutor Yagami?

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:52.990
Yep, and she has him tied
around her finger.

00:23:53.390 --> 00:23:56.260
It's scary when a young girl
is in love.

00:23:56.620 --> 00:24:00.080
Next: "Yagami's Back! Just
When You Least Expect Her!"

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:02.180
Hang in there, Manager.
